I am in the Infopark office.
There is a nice coolness from the AC in the office.
I sit at my desk.
I type the new software on the computer.
Then Prakash comes near me.
He is my colleague.
Prakash stands next to my desk.
We look at the computer screen together.
"Maya, is this for the new project?" Prakash asks.
"Yes, I am preparing my part for it," I say.
He points a finger at the screen.
"This part is very good," he says.
"Thank you Prakash," I say.
We talk about the upcoming project.
Prakash says some new things.
He helps me a lot.
I type on the computer again.
There is a lot of work today.
